# Customer email goes through GoHighLevel

All customer email goes through GoHighLevel. The app POSTs a flat JSON event to a GoHighLevel inbound webhook, and a GoHighLevel workflow sends the email.

Never add Resend, SendGrid, Postmark, SMTP, or any other direct email provider.

Each new email type needs its own webhook URL secret and a GoHighLevel workflow. Coordinate that workflow with the GHL Dev bot.

Server-side Purchase goes through Stape.

Shared sender: `supabase/functions/_shared/ghl-email-webhook.ts` (`postGhlEmailEvent`). A missing URL or a failed POST is logged on `customer_message_events` with provider `ghl` (`sent`, `failed`, or detail `missing_url`) and does not fail the caller.
